    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Univoyager is an ambitious indie Space Simulator created on a custom 3d engine where you can travel among the stars, explore planets and starports, trade and combat in a procedurally generated 1:1 universe with seamless planetary  and interstellar flight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Features: <br>-Seamless transition between Space/Planet and seamless Interplanetary and Interstellar travels<br>-Realistic Physics: Gravity, Collisions, Atmospheric Drag, Flying Dynamics <br>-Planetary Orbits of the Solar System bodies calculated according to real Orbital Data <br>-Database with more than 100,000 stars to explore <br>-Planets and Stars in Real Size and Real Distance <br>-Planet Maps are calculated starting from real data (where available) and take advantage of procedural algorithms to create close up details.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Univoyager is an ambitious indie Space Simulator created on a custom 3d engine where you can travel among the stars, explore planets and starports, trade and combat in a procedurally generated 1:1 universe with seamless planetary  and interstellar flight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Features: <br>-Seamless transition between Space/Planet and seamless Interplanetary and Interstellar travels<br>-Realistic Physics: Gravity, Collisions, Atmospheric Drag, Flying Dynamics <br>-Planetary Orbits of the Solar System bodies calculated according to real Orbital Data <br>-Database with more than 100,000 stars to explore <br>-Planets and Stars in Real Size and Real Distance <br>-Planet Maps are calculated starting from real data (where available) and take advantage of procedural algorithms to create close up details.</p>",
    "short_description": "Travel among the stars, explore planets and starports using realistic physics, trade and combat in a procedurally generated 1:1 universe with seamless planetary and interstellar flight.",
